   https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/2847/oj/eng
   Supports: scope and interaction with machinery rules; manufacturer lifecycle and technical-documentation duties; reporting steps and application dates. Claims `01-cra-scope`, `01-cra-dates`, `01-cra-lifecycle`.

