     8	## Executive Summary & Gate Evaluation
     9	
    10	Essay 01 is an exceptionally rigorous, disciplined analysis of a managed compliance-operations business. It scrupulously adheres to the book's core mandate: separating legal obligations from commercial willingness to pay, refusing "platform" hand-waving, providing a fully legible bottom-up financial model, confronting direct vendor and internal substitutes, and framing a non-straw-man capable failure mode.
