    42	* **What Cited Sources Support:**
    43	  Regulation (EU) 2023/2854 (Data Act), Article 3(1)–(3) (Claim `01-data-duty`). The citation accurately reflects the legal text, but combining the design obligation and pre-contract disclosure across a semicolon exceeds 40 words.
